      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "こいつは悪いウサギだった。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4715",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は山にいました。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Swift",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4716",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それは最近の写真？"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4717",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "時間があるか分かりません。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4718",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "先程、どういうわけかマイクが入りませんでした。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4720",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "この世界の教育にはがっかりしてしまう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4726",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は一日に100ユーロ稼ぎます。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4727",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "すぐに諦めて昼寝をするかも知れない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Sim5634",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4728",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それはあなたが一人になりたくないからです。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4729",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "そんなことは起きないでしょう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4730",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "彼は時々変です。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4731",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "あなたの勉強を邪魔しないようにします。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4732",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "みんなもそうなのかな、と思うことくらいしかできない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
