      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は彼らにチケットをもう一枚送ってくれるように頼んだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4741",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "君は僕にとてもいらいらしている。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4742",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私はそんな風には生きられない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4743",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は一時期、天体物理学者になりたかった。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4744",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "生物学は好きになれません。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4745",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "僕が最後に自分の考えを伝えた人は、僕を気違いだと思ったようだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4746",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "残念ながらそれは本当なのです。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4747",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "大抵の人は僕を気違いだと思っている。"
    },
    {
      "author": "kame",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4748",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は違います。あなたです。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4749",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それは私の台詞だよ！"
    },
    {
      "author": "kame",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4750",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "彼は私を蹴っています！"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4751",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "本当？"
    },
    {
      "author": "e4zh1nmcz",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4752",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "そうしたらひとつ問題があって・・・。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4753",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "あ！蝶々がいる！"
    },
    {
      "author": "blay_paul",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4754",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "急いで！"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4755",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "驚くことではないね。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4757",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私はなぜか夜の方が元気だ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4758",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それは文脈による。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4759",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "冗談でしょ！？"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4760",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "こんな馬鹿なことは言ったことが無い。"
    },
    {
      "author": "hambird",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4761",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "のろまにはなりたくない。かっこ良くなりたい！！"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4762",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "大きくなったら王様になりたい。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4763",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "お金を稼ぎたいならアメリカが一番だ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4764",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "僕はすごく太ってる。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4765",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "だから何？"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4766",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "こらしめてやる。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4767",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "言ってみただけだよ！"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4768",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それで彼らの気が変わったのかも知れない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4769",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "兄弟がいるとどんなだろうといつも思う。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4770",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私ならそう言っただろうと思う。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4771",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "いつまでかかっても全部を説明するのは無理だ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4772",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "あなたが女の子だからよ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4773",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "時々感情が抑えられないことがある。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4774",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "これは代わりになるものをみつけたい単語だ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4775",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "自分勝手にするつもりはない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4776",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "最悪の場合を考えておこう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4777",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "親友は何人いる？"
    },
    {
      "author": "kame",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4778",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は反社会的かもしれないけれど人と話さないわけではない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4779",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "そういうものなんです。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4780",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "失礼に振舞ったりしないのが一番だと思う。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4781",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "時間はいくらでも作れる。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4782",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "僕は不幸かも知れないけれど自殺はしない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4783",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "高校生の時は毎朝6時に起きていた。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4784",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "起きた時私は悲しかった。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4785",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "あなたは新しいことを勉強したいのだと思った。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4786",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "多くの人が日常のことについて文を書く。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4787",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-06",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それをするためには危険を冒さなければならない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4788",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "孤独な人は、他人を恐れるから一人なのだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4789",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "なんで聞くの？"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4790",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は芸術家ではない。全然向いていない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4791",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "もう彼女には言えないよ。そんなに単純なことではなくなってきたからね。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4792",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "傷を付けたのは私だけど、こんなの簡単に直せる傷よ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4793",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "欲しいものがみつかると、決まって高いものだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4794",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "どのくらいいたの？"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4795",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "たぶん彼にしてみれば同じことよ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4796",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "潔白であることは美しいことだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4797",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "人間は決して永遠には生きられないものだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "kame",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4798",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "行き過ぎたものであっても、僕は自分の考えをなくしたくない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4799",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それは面白い。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4800",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "自分のかっこ良さをわざと隠すということ？"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4801",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "もし誰かにこの話の要点は何かって尋ねられても、私はさっぱりわからないわ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4802",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それがどこから来たのか分からなかった。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4803",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "僕が君と一緒に住んだことは君の人生観に影響を与えたと思う。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4804",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "これは重要ではない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4805",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "好きにはなれなかった。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4806",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "彼女は、どうしてそんなことが可能なのかと尋ねている。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4807",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "君はただ人生の問題から逃げているだけだよ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4808",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "歌詞を見てみれば、あまり意味が無いことに気付くでしょう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4809",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "君の気付いていない問題がある。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4810",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "できるよ！"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4811",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私の物理の先生は授業をサボっても気にしない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4812",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "日本へ行けたらいいのに。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4813",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "人ごみは大嫌い。"
    },
    {
      "author": "blay_paul",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4814",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は寝なければなりません。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4815",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "その後私はそこを出るんだけど、鞄を忘れてきたことに気付くんだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4816",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "今日はもう聞かないよ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4817",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "来週には凍るかも知れない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4818",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "謝罪はあったにせよ、私はまだ彼に腹を立てている。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4819",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "警察はあなたに弾丸をみつけさせるでしょう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4820",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "なぜみんなが私のことを気違いだと思うのか、遂に説明してくれてありがとう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4821",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "そんなつもりではなかったんだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4822",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "説明してくれてありがとう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "StephenCase",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4823",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "理論的には、私は数学をしている。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4824",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "何が起きたの？"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4825",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "丸一日オンラインで君を見ないなんてびっくりだよ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4826",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "何が言いたいのか分からないなあ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4827",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-10",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私のパソコンは何かの役に立つはずだ。"
    }
  ],
